{"about_the_game":"<strong>Aliosso is a turn-based roguelike all about combining tiles and cards to win battles and survive a perilous journey across the desert of Samsara.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=816 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.webm?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.mp4?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Customize your tiles</strong>: place a rune, increase their trigger value, set an edition, or change their type entirely! Find the right cards that synergize with your tiles, and turn that <strong>Power</strong> into devastating strikes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/f9e6ebb3a25d03ee916a3c9b85460df6.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=1000 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/f9e6ebb3a25d03ee916a3c9b85460df6.webm?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/f9e6ebb3a25d03ee916a3c9b85460df6.mp4?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Cards represent run-altering effects</strong> that can influence just about anything. The rules are malleable, like sand.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SWAY DESTINY WITH AN OFFERING OF WATER</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/13e1545de01abcbb6f9d623dd4548ee2.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=894 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/13e1545de01abcbb6f9d623dd4548ee2.webm?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/13e1545de01abcbb6f9d623dd4548ee2.mp4?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Prayers affect the battlefield and your run, but require a sacrifice of water</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Rule-breaking</strong>: banish a card for the entire run or copy a tile onto another \u2014 reshape the rules in your favor.</li></ul><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/8ba21f92d6b6559a2c853bc8f6b431aa.avif?t=1767712441\" width=800 height=405 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Will you restock on water or look for treasures?<br></li><li>Use canyons, caverns, and other locations to avoid the searing heat of the desert, but beware: no place is without peril.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/c5d150deff07334a7527c1b265cd5719.avif?t=1767712441\" width=600 height=161 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>6 champions</strong> of the desert clans, each with its own run-defining power and tiles.<br></li><li><strong>100+ cards</strong> along with card variants to influence battles and scenarios.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of tiles</strong> to make combos with or to use for their special effect.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of runes</strong> for tile upgrades and extra perks.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of prayers</strong> to use as an escape hatch in difficult situations and to steer the journey in your favor.<br></li><li><strong>Dozens of scenarios</strong> to face.<br></li><li><strong>Different locations</strong> to explore along your journey.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/dd80bcb3e58fee41dbfd8a711c19d925.avif?t=1767712441\" width=830 height=278 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A DARK DJINN'S RETURN</h2></strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=618 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.webm?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.mp4?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The last surviving human clans endure a nomadic existence fraught with hardship. As generations passed, the history of Samsara faded into oblivion. Long forgotten, <strong>a dark Djinn has found its way back</strong>, driven by an insatiable desire to reclaim its full powers and extend its supreme will on the desert and beyond.</p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2730820?t=1767712441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2730820?t=1767712441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/6e281adddda5057a3b5b784ce2a63916d359e0a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767712441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/6e281adddda5057a3b5b784ce2a63916d359e0a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767712441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3499030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Aliosso is a turn-based roguelike all about combining tiles and cards to win battles and survive a perilous journey across the desert of Samsara.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=816 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.webm?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/9eb2ed080fbe705c238351e84290efff.mp4?t=1767712441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Customize your tiles</strong>: place a rune, increase their trigger value, set an edition, or change their type entirely! Find the right cards that synergize with your tiles, and turn that <strong>Power</strong> into devastating strikes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/f9e6ebb3a25d03ee916a3c9b85460df6.poster.avif?t=1767712441\" width=1000 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/f9e6ebb3a25d03ee916a3c9b85460df6.w